Begin Object Class=/Script/CoreUObject.Interface Name="BPI_CheckpointListener"
End Object

/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Blueprint Interface: BPI_CheckpointListener
Asset Path: /Game/Blueprints/Triggers/BPI_CheckpointListener
Target: BP_VelocityHUD, AVELOCITYXGameMode, BP_MainGameMapLevel, Audio Managers
Author: Level Designer
================================================================================

INTERFACE FUNCTIONS:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. OnCheckpointCrossedNotification:
   Broadcasted when any vehicle traverses a sector checkpoint.
   Inputs:
     - CheckpointIndex (Integer): Sequence number (1, 2, 3, 4...)
     - CheckpointName (String): Display name (e.g. "SECTOR 1 SPLIT", "HIGHWAY PASS")
     - SplitTimeSeconds (Float): Elapsed race clock time at point of crossing
     - SplitDeltaSeconds (Float): Comparison delta against current best lap (+/- seconds)
     - TrapSpeedKPH (Float): Instantaneous trap velocity in km/h
     - TrapSpeedMPH (Float): Instantaneous trap velocity in mph
     - PassingVehicle (Actor): Vehicle actor that triggered the gate

2. OnStartLineCrossedNotification:
   Broadcasted when starting line timing laser is broken.
   Inputs:
     - StartTimestamp (Float): World time seconds
     - PassingVehicle (Actor): Vehicle actor

3. OnFinishLineCrossedNotification:
   Broadcasted when checkered finish line is crossed.
   Inputs:
     - FinalRaceTime (Float): Total race duration
     - TopSpeedKPH (Float): Peak speed attained across the course
     - PassingVehicle (Actor): Vehicle actor
     - bNewCourseRecord (Boolean): True if current run beat GameInstance best time

4. OnVehicleRecoveredNotification:
   Broadcasted when vehicle unstuck recovery teleport is performed.
   Inputs:
     - RecoveredVehicle (Actor): Vehicle actor
     - RecoveryLocation (Vector): Safe respawn world position
     - RecoveryHeadingDegrees (Float): Safe respawn yaw rotation
================================================================================
*/
